uth Wales, Australia. It is responsible for purchasing products from Beiersdorf AG and Nestle, conducting inspections to ensure quality compliance. These efforts reflect Tesco's commitment to innovation, quality, and customer satisfaction in its operations.", "DANIEL SMITH:Daniel Smith is the contact person and Procurement Manager for Nestle, responsible for overseeing the agreement from the supplier's side", "RACHEL GREEN:Rachel Green is the contact person and Supply Chain Director for Tesco, responsible for managing the agreement from the buyer's side", "NEW YORK, UNITED STATES:New York, United States serves as the governing law jurisdiction for the procurement agreement. It is the designated location where the governing law of the agreement is established. Additionally, New York is the site for dispute resolution, where arbitration will occur in the event of any disagreements related to the procurement agreement.", "BELLA VISTA, NEW SOUTH WALES, AUSTRALIA:Bella Vista, New South Wales, Australia is noted as the location for both Costco's and Tesco's addresses as mentioned in the procurement agreement.", "PURCHASE, NEW YORK, UNITED STATES:Purchase, New York, United States is a significant location mentioned in a procurement agreement, serving as the address for multiple major corporations. It is identified as the address for Grupo Bimbo, Nestle, and Procter & Gamble, highlighting its importance as a hub for these prominent companies.", "WOOLWORTHS WAY, BELLA VISTA, NEW SOUTH WALES, AUSTRALIA:WOOLWORTHS WAY, BELLA VISTA, NEW SOUTH WALES, AUSTRALIA is mentioned as the address of both Costco's and Tesco's offices in the procurement agreement.", "ANDERSON HILL ROAD, PURCHASE, NEW YORK, UNITED STATES:"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}